WEBVTT

00:00:28.747 --> 00:00:30.791
[Made possible with
the support of Dropbox]

00:00:30.815 --> 00:00:32.552
Twelve years ago, I founded CY,

00:00:32.576 --> 00:00:34.136
an outsource call center

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.402
staffed and managed entirely by underdogs.

00:00:37.426 --> 00:00:40.176
More than half
of our hundreds of employees

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.610
are severely disabled.

00:00:41.634 --> 00:00:44.514
Others come from other
disadvantaged populations

00:00:44.538 --> 00:00:46.306
or just suffer from anxiety,

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:48.296
low self-esteem and lack of confidence.

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.446
The problem I needed to solve
when we started out was

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:53.946
that traditional
interviewing and screening,

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:56.016
especially for entry-level positions,

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.176
are totally biased towards people

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:01.066
who function well under intense stress.